out.push(A('**One student reads a sentence with _significant_ in it and then the same sentence with a count in place of it.** ⚠ **The room says where the stress fell in each.** **The first has nowhere to put one and the second has three places** — **and a sentence with nothing to stress is a sentence with nothing in it, which the ear finds faster than the eye.** **Close on Mrs Rizk\'s sentence: three of my four colleagues knew.**'));
