out.push(A('**a** Open. ⚠ **The part and not the sentence.** **In most classes seven or eight of the ten fragments are an idiom or an institutional word**, and two or three are a hedge. **Write the ten fragments and sort them in front of the room at 3R rather than now** — **the sorting is the lesson and the fourth group has not been mentioned yet.**'));
